ic Bilibili Toy build during an opening Normal-mode movement check.","src","/GameMap/media/learning/clockout-unseen-codex.webp","alt","Office-stealth gameplay with the player behind desks, a coworker, a minimap and 149 seconds remaining.","https://www.bilibili.com/toy/clockout-unseen/index.html","width",1280,"height",720,"credit","GameMap browser capture","list","attribution","创作者记录中的客户端与模型","items",[87],"Codex","links","相关资源",[93],"resourceIds","section",{"_62":94,"_25":95},"OpenAI Codex","/zh/resources/codex/","创作者开发记录",[99],"evidence",{"_62":100,"_25":101,"_102":103},"查看 Codex 与人工的贡献说明","https://github.com/Ryan-fm/clockout-unseen/blob/main/docs/DEVELOPMENT.md","note","Creator record names GPT-6 Astra in Codex, gives selected requests and distinguishes independently generated artwork from coding-model work.","源码内容","complete project","项目源码",[108],{"_62":109,"_25":110,"_102":111},"查看完整游戏项目","https://github.com/Ryan-fm/clockout-unseen","Complete React/Canvas source, maps, original office/character PNGs, tests and Vite configuration. Run npm ci then npm run dev. No runtime AI key. README labels current source V2; verify hosted-version differences before comparing features.","获取方式","playable","demo","试玩与运行",[117],{"_62":118,"_25":75,"_102":119},"试玩 Clock Out Unseen","Chinese interface on Bilibili Toy. Wait for scene assets, then start a level. WASD/arrows move, E interacts and Space uses a folder disguise; mobile joystick/buttons are supplied. The game opened and started without sign-in.","游戏平台","浏览器","指南形式","build log","tutorial","开发记录与教程",[127],{"_62":128,"_25":101,"_102":-7},"阅读作者的开发记录","研究这个工作流","ordered",true,[133,134,135,136],"Start Normal mode and move behind office furniture.","Read the selected prompts and model contribution record.","Trace movement, line-of-sight and disguise rules in the engine.","Change one patrol rule and check immediate detection, retry and level progression.","AI 工作流与开发背景","Ryan-fm 提出办公室潜行概念并确认视觉方向。Codex 中的 GPT-6 Astra 多轮实现碰撞、视线、巡逻、互动、关卡衔接、手机操作和测试；办公室与人物图片由独立图像生成工具制作。","aiUse","guidance","创作方式","AI 辅助（创作者归属）","category","provenance","方向","2D","track","metadata","引擎","Canvas 2D · React UI","engine","lead","2d","ai-assisted",[133,134,135,136],{"_62":167,"_25":101,"_17":168},{"_62":166,"_25":75,"_17":113,"_102":119},{"_62":163,"_25":110,"_164":165,"_102":111},{"_62":162,"_25":101,"_102":103},[161],"codex","Read the explicit Codex and human contribution account","Open the complete game project","scope","complete-project","Play Clock Out Unseen","Read the creator’s development record","build-log",{"_170":171},"documents",{"_67":172,"_35":173},[175,179,180,181,178,182,183,184,185,186,187,188,189,190,191,192,193,194,195,196,197,198,199,200,201,202,203,204,205,206,207,208,209,210,211,212,213,177,214,176,215,216,217,218,219,220,221,222,223,224,225,226,227,228,229,230,231,232,233,234,235],[174,175,176,177,178],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","production-coverage-gaps","generative-tools-research","generative-api-boundaries","generation-delivery-contracts","asset-validation-contracts","asset-selection-feedback","visual-evidence-research","visual-feedback-mechanisms","game-development-evaluation","benchmark-reproducibility","gameplay-state-contracts","agent-interface-evidence","catalog-review-coverage","source-revision-notes","community-case-research","overview","catalog","contributing","media-sources","icon-sources","content-model","skills/level-design/SKILL","skills/level-design/LICENSE","design/design-system","design/v2/design-system","editorial-art-prompts","skills/level-design/references/blockout-metrics